stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SpecDraft: Human writes task spec
  SpecDraft --> Decomposed: Planner agent breaks into subtasks
  Decomposed --> Queued: Cards land on board

  state "Board statuses" as Board {
    [*] --> InDev
    InDev --> InProgress: Worker claims task
    InProgress --> Blocked: Needs more input
    Blocked --> InProgress: Human provides input
    InProgress --> DoneSuccess: Acceptance criteria met
    InProgress --> DoneFailed: Unrecoverable / max loops
  }

  Queued --> InDev
  DoneSuccess --> [*]
  DoneFailed --> [*]: Review / retry later
